<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ResearchLoops — this mod's own research page.

  Core's Defs/ResearchProjectDefs/ResearchTabs.xml says exactly how to do this:
  "To add a research tab, make a new ResearchTabDef here and then set the <tab> field of your
   research project to match it".

  Every loop def generated by PatchOperation_GenerateLoopDefs carries <tab>ResearchLoops</tab>,
  so the main research tree stays free of loop nodes (verified panel behaviour: ListProjects
  skips any def whose tab != the current tab), and each loop has its own coordinates in this
  page instead of colliding with vanilla techs.

  visibleByDefault=true keeps the page reachable from the first game: ResearchManager reads it
  on a fresh save, and on an existing save its PostLoadInit pass sets every visibleByDefault
  tab back to visible, so old saves pick the page up too.
-->
<Defs>

  <ResearchTabDef>
    <defName>ResearchLoops</defName>
    <label>循环科技</label>
    <generalTitle>循环科技</generalTitle>
    <generalDescription>这里的每一项科技都是一条可以反复研究的循环链：研究完一级，同一个节点就地变为下一级，成本与收益随之提高，效果永久叠加。

所有循环科技的前置都是「多元分析仪」；研究收益只作用于你自己的殖民者与奴隶。</generalDescription>
    <visibleByDefault>true</visibleByDefault>
  </ResearchTabDef>

</Defs>
